                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Centerpoint currently operates 80 beds and is in the middle of a $15 million expansion that will add 30 new beds, with the first expected to open in January. This expansion will help meet the growing demand for critical mental health services in mid-Missouri.",
