                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Proud to visit RUSK Rehabilitation Hospital in Columbia \u2014 where Encompass Health and MU Health Care are changing lives every day through world-class rehabilitative care.\n\nThank you to Medical Director Dr. Joseph Burris and Chief Nursing Officer Elizabeth Bagby for showing us around and for all you do to help Missourians heal and get back on their feet!",
