                "text": "Unfortunately, Schumer still has the government in a shutdown, but we're still working for you!\n\nVisited Landmark Hospital of Columbia with CEO Sharon Noe to learn more about the exceptional care they provide to patients needing long-term, complex medical treatment. https://t.co/n8KJdpzxIo",
