                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Even during the Schumer Shutdown, our team is staying focused on what matters most: our communities. Today we are at Royal Oaks Hospital in Windsor, Missouri, part of the Compass Health Network, where kids from across Missouri come for critical behavioral and mental health treatment.",
