                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "\ud83d\udccdWarrensburg, MO \n\nIt\u2019s Day 22 of the Schumer Shutdown, but we\u2019re still working hard for MO-04. Our team visited Western Missouri Medical Center in Warrensburg, Missouri to meet with CEO Darinda Dick to learn more about their day-to-day operations and how we can support rural hospitals at the federal level. \n\nWe got to see their Telehealth robot in action and hear about the real challenges they\u2019re facing with Medicare and Medicare Advantage. \n\nThank you to this operation's commitment to serving patients across rural Missouri!",
                "text_lang": "en",
