                "text": "Great news for Clinton and families across West Central Missouri: $1.6 MILLION for a new Maternal Health Center at Golden Valley Memorial Hospital is now signed into law. \n\nWe were proud to lead the fight in @HouseAppropsGOP. Thank you, @POTUS for making it official. https://t.co/7nfRMRa0Tp",
