                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Today is National Rural Health Day is a reminder of what\u2019s at stake. I\u2019ve been in nearly every rural hospital across the Fourth District, talking with the people who are doing everything they can to keep health care close to home. https://t.co/47RsdwLOws",
