                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "When the government shut down, we didn\u2019t. We kept visiting hospitals because rural Missouri can\u2019t afford political games. Democrats wanted to put the $50B Rural Health Transformation Program on the chopping block.\n\nWe actively fought to stop that and keep our rural hospitals open\u2014for the families who depend on them!",
