                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 3,
                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Great to be in Osage Beach touring the Osage Beach Behavioral Health Facility with Roger Smyth III, Becky Cole, Jolyn O\u2019Cain, and Rob Monsees. \n\nThis 18-bed adult unit is doing critical work\u2014treating Missourians facing psychiatric and behavioral health challenges, including manic depression. \n\nTheir team delivers real results with an average stay of just 7\u201310 days. Proud of the care being provided right here in our district!",
