                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Toured the joint Jordan Valley and Compass Health facility in Lebanon, Missouri \u2014 a true one-stop shop for families in Laclede County. From vision and dental services to primary care and therapy, this team is delivering compassionate, comprehensive care all under one roof.\n\nGrateful to Jordan Valley Medical and Compass Health leadership for showing our team the incredible work they\u2019re doing to keep our community healthy and supported. Proud to see this level of commitment right here in the heart of Missouri\u2019s 4th District!",
