                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Stopped by Mercy Lebanon to visit with their leadership team about how we can support our rural hospitals at the federal level. \n\nJenn Speer shared an incredible program helping patients battling substance abuse leave with a 3-day supply of needed medication \u2014 with Dr. Michael Crease personally following up to ensure continued care. This is real compassion in action. \n\nGrateful for Jenn, LeeAnn Pendergraft, Jason Purcell, and Board Chair Greg Bechtel for the tour.",
