                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Just had an inspiring conversation with Ambassador Justice Esme J. Chombo from Malawi!\n\nWe dove into the incredible lifesaving work of Project C.U.R.E., delivering vital medical supplies and equipment straight to hospitals in Malawi, thanks to generous donors and partners. Proud to share that Project C.U.R.E. has a major hub right here in Kansas City.\n\nThe Show-Me State is making a huge global impact!",
